              "text": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n  <title>Paws & Coffee</title>\n  <style>\n    body {\n      margin: 0;\n      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n      background: #fff8f0;\n      color: #333;\n      text-align: center;\n    }\n    .hero {\n      padding: 80px 20px;\n      background: #f4d6a0;\n    }\n    h1 {\n      font-size: 3rem;\n      margin-bottom: 10px;\n    }\n    p {\n      font-size: 1.1rem;\n      max-width: 600px;\n      margin: 0 auto 20px;\n    }\n    .btn {\n      display: inline-block;\n      padding: 12px 24px;\n      background: #8b5e3c;\n      color: white;\n      text-decoration: none;\n      border-radius: 8px;\n    }\n    .btn:hover {\n      background: #6f472d;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <section class=\"hero\">\n    <h1>Paws & Coffee</h1>\n    <p>Relax with a warm drink while spending time with friendly, playful dogs. Enjoy handcrafted coffee, fresh pastries, and plenty of tail wags in a cozy café made for dog lovers.</p>\n    <a href=\"#\" class=\"btn\">Visit Us</a>\n  </section>\n</body>\n</html>",
